sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as User
    participant Ctrl as BreakGlassController
    participant Guard as PermissionsGuard
    participant Svc as BreakGlassService
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant Audit as AuditService
    participant Outbox as Outbox

    User->>Ctrl: POST /break-glass {permission, resourceType, resourceId, reason, expiresInMinutes}
    Ctrl->>Guard: Check break_glass.request
    Guard-->>Ctrl: Allowed
    Ctrl->>Svc: request(input)
    Svc->>Svc: Validate permission in catalog
    Svc->>Svc: Check user does not already hold permission (hard rule)
    Svc->>Svc: Enforce expiresInMinutes <= 60
    Svc->>DB: Create BreakGlassGrant (status PENDING)
    Svc->>Audit: audit break_glass.requested
    Svc->>Outbox: Emit BreakGlassGrantRequested
    Svc-->>Ctrl: Grant recorded
    Ctrl-->>User: Request recorded
    Note over Svc: No code path activates PENDING grants in this phase
    Note over DB: Activation would require manual DB write (audited separately)
    User->>Ctrl: GET /break-glass/mine
    User->>Ctrl: GET /break-glass (requires break_glass.manage)
    User->>Ctrl: POST /break-glass/:id/expire (requires break_glass.manage)
